  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In order to move forward with the use of the new Fedora client for integration tests, we need to decide on whether to continue to use Jersey as the Web services client library therein or switch, as the server has, to using Apache CXF.",
       "type": "text"
      }
